Too right. that archon fight was something else. I polymorphed twice,
used up two amulets of LS, and tried just about every trick I knew, and
he _still_ bagged me. I hadn't thought to anti-Xorn and re-armor after the
earth level, so my AC just wasn't low enough.

OTOH, the character who ascended was almost painfully boring at times.
After seven wishes in the castle, your only real enemy is yourself. I
won't wish for artifacts anymore, 'cause it's just TOO EASY with the
PYEC.

